<title>CHINA: Deutsche Bank sets warrants on COSCO.</title>
<headline>Deutsche Bank sets warrants on COSCO.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Deutsche Bank AG, London Branch, said  on Friday it launched 128.80 million American-style call warrants  on shares of COSCO Pacific Ltd.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	HK$16.11     PREMIUM	 14.8 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	 HK$0.444     GEARING	 4.03x</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	  01.JUN.98    LISTING DATE  22.AUG.97</p>
<p> LISTING	     HONG KONG    PAYDATE	 20.AUG.97</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE    HK$17.90     MIN EXER LOT  20,000</p>
<p> SETTLEMENT	  PHYSICAL ONLY</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
